<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets call and put warrants on S&amp;P500.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets call and put warrants on S&amp;P500.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued 30 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co oHG said.</p>
<p>One index is controlled by 10 warrants. Strikes for the calls and puts are at 630, 680 and 730. The exercise period runs from October 8 until January 30, 1998.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
